    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daydream Mosaics: Juliette\u2019s Collection brings together a vibrant selection of six-color nonogram puzzles curated from previous entries in the beloved franchise. Choose your game mode and play style\u2014enjoy classic picross gameplay or dive into the enhanced Mosaic mode with power-ups and a mistake counter. With dozens of colorful puzzles and more on the way, this collection offers something for every logic puzzle fan.</p>",
